# Small talk (only when nothing else is left). {subject} the id (a like id, pet, place, lunch, exams, weather, weekend,
# school), {thing} its words, {like}/{likes} for likes (likes=yes when she really likes it), {pet} her pet theme.
# 2026-10-27: more lines; small.plain was the "nothing to say" answer and repeated too much.

@rule me.small
on me.small
- [So... {thing}, huh?|What do you think about {thing}?|Been thinking about {thing} lately?]
- [Hey, random question: {thing}?|Can I ask you about {thing}?|I was wondering about {thing}.]
- [Got any thoughts on {thing}?|What's your take on {thing}?]
- [Funny, I was just thinking about {thing}.|Do you ever think about {thing}?]
- [I've got a question about {thing}.|You seem like you'd know about {thing}.] [Got a second?|What do you say?]
- [Someone brought up {thing} earlier.|{Thing} came up in class.] [What do you make of it?|Made me think of you.]
- [Tell me something about {thing}.|What's the deal with {thing}?]
- [I can't stop thinking about {thing}.|I don't know much about {thing}.] [You?|Help me out.]
- [Random, but {thing}.|Okay, serious topic: {thing}.] [Go.|Your thoughts?]

@rule me.small.weather
on me.small
when subject=weather
- [Nice weather today, huh?|It's [warm|chilly|cloudy] today.|Do you think it'll rain later?]
- [Did you see the sky this morning?|Perfect day to skip class, right?|The wind's crazy today.]
- [Feels like it's going to [rain|clear up] later.|The sun's finally out.|Is it me, or is it humid today?]
- [Did you bring a jacket?|Is it just me, or did it get colder?|Is it hot in here or is it the weather?]
- [Good day for the roof, huh?|You think it'll hold until we go home?]
- [This weather makes me sleepy.|I can't tell what to wear anymore.] [You too?|How about you?]
- [They said it'd change by tonight.|The forecast was wrong again.] [Typical.|Did you see it?]
- [Look outside.|Have you been outside yet?] [Not bad, right?|What a day.]

@rule me.small.like
on me.small
when likes=yes|no
- [Are you into {like}?|Do you like {like}?|What do you think about {like}?]
- [Ever tried {like}?|I heard you might like {like}.|How do you feel about {like}?]
- [Are you a {like} kind of person?|Quick question: {like}, yes or no?|Somebody told me you're into {like}. True?]
- [Do you know much about {like}?|You seem like someone who knows {like}.]
- [Be honest: {like}?|Settle a bet for me: {like}, good or bad?]
- [I've been meaning to try {like}.|I was just talking about {like}.] [Any thoughts?|You into that?]
- [If I said {like}, what would you say?|What's your opinion on {like}?]
- [I can't figure out if you like {like}.|You look like a fan of {like}.] [Am I right?|Do you?]

@rule me.small.place
on me.small
when subject=place
- [I like {thing}.|This place is nice, huh?|You come here often?]
- [It's calm here.|Do you hang out here a lot?|Good spot, right?]
- [Feels different here than in class.|I didn't expect to find you here.|Nice place to take a breather.]
- [I always see you around here.|Is this where you usually go?] [Good choice.|Why here?]
- [{Thing} is nicer than I remembered.|I never noticed this spot.] [Do you like it?|Is it always this quiet?]
- [What brings you to {thing}?|Are you waiting for someone?]
- [Mind if I hang out here too?|Is this seat taken?]
- [I could get used to {thing}.|Everyone should come here more.] [Right?|Don't you think?]

@rule me.small.stranger
on me.small
when rel=stranger
- [Hi. I don't think we've really talked before.|Hey. Nice day, huh?]
- [Hey, you're in my year, right?|Hi! Mind if I say hello?|Hey there. How's it going?]
- [Hi. We keep passing each other, so...|Hey, I'm in your grade. Thought I'd say hi.|Hello! I don't bite, promise.]
- [Sorry to bother you.|Excuse me.] [I just wanted to say hi.|Can I talk to you for a second?]
- [I don't know many people here yet.|I've been meaning to introduce myself.]
- [You're in the {club}, right?|I've seen you around campus.] [Thought I'd finally say something.|Nice to meet you.]
- [Hi. I'm the one who sits near the back.|I'm trying to meet more people.] [So, hello.|So... hi.]
- [This is awkward, but hi.|I'm bad at this, but hi.]

@rule small.plain.any~state
on small
shape state
hook plain_any
opens ask,share,tease
- Hm, {thing}? I guess so. It's alright.
- {Thing}... sure. I don't think about it much.
- Ahh, {thing}... It reminds me of something.
- Mm, {thing}. I had a dream about that, weirdly.
- Ahh, {thing}... It's okay.
- {Thing}. Sure. Next question. Just kidding.

@rule small.plain.unsure~state
on small
shape state
hook plain_unsure
opens ask,share,tease
- {Thing}? Funny you ask. I have mixed feelings.
- Oh, {thing}. It depends on the day.
- Honestly? No idea. Never really thought about it.
- Hmm, {thing}... Ask me something harder.
- Honestly? No idea. I'd have to think about that.
- Not much to say about {thing}. You seem more into it than me.
- {Thing}... I had an opinion on that once. It's gone now.
- I don't have much to add on {thing}. Sorry.
- People have strong feelings about {thing}. I'm not one of them.
- Not everyone gets {thing}. I'm in the middle.
- You know, nobody's asked me that before. Give me a second.

@rule small.plain.surprised~state
on small
shape state
hook plain_surprised
opens ask,share,tease
- Oh, that's random. But sure, {thing}.
- Where'd that come from? I don't mind talking about it.

@rule small.plain.surprised~q
on small
shape q
hook plain_surprised
opens ask,share,tease
- {Thing}? Funny you ask. Why, do you like it?
- {Thing} is fine, I suppose. What about you?
- You came all the way here to ask about {thing}? Okay.
- So that's what you want to talk about? Fine by me.
- That's a new one. I guess it's okay?

@rule small.plain.unsure~q
on small
shape q
hook plain_unsure
opens ask,share,tease
- Can I get back to you on {thing}? My brain's slow right now.

@rule small.like.yes.fan~state
on small
when likes=yes
feel smile
shape state
hook like_yes_fan
opens ask,share,tease
- {Like}? I love {like}! I could talk about it all day.
- Oh, {like}! Don't get me started. It's kind of my thing.
- Oh my gosh, {like}! You just made my day.
- {Like} is the best, honestly. I spend way too much time on it.
- Ah, you found my weak spot. Don't tell anyone how obsessed I am.
- Ooh, now you're talking. {Like}, every day if I could.
- You know the way to my heart. Let me tell you about my favorite part.
- I was just thinking about {like} this morning. Seriously.
- {student}If I could skip class for {like}, I would. No regrets.
- My room is basically a shrine to {like}. Don't laugh.

@rule small.like.yes.invite~state
on small
when likes=yes
feel smile
shape state
hook like_yes_invite
opens ask,invite,tease
- You need the full {like} experience. I'll show you.

@rule small.like.yes.fan~q
on small
when likes=yes
feel smile
shape q
hook like_yes_fan
opens ask,share,tease
- You like {like} too? Finally someone asks!
- Wait, are you into {like}? We have to talk about this.
- How long have you got? Because {like} is my favorite subject.
- Do you have an hour? I've got opinions about {like}.
- {Like} got me through this week. Is it that obvious?
- Who told you I like {like}? I'm impressed.
- You remembered about {like}? Thanks for asking.

@rule small.like.yes.invite~offer
on small
when likes=yes
feel smile
shape offer
hook like_yes_invite
opens ask,invite,tease
- We should do something with {like} sometime. I'm serious.

@rule small.like.no.pass~state
on small
when likes=no
shape state
hook like_no_pass
opens ask,agree,tease
- {Like}? Not really my thing. But I don't mind it.
- {Like}? Not really my thing. I've never really gotten into it.
- I'm kind of neutral on {like}. It's fine, I guess.
- Ha, {like}? Me? No. It didn't stick.
- I tried {like} once. Wasn't for me.
- My friends love {like}. I just nod along. It's fine.
- Everyone around me talks about {like}. I don't get it.
- I'd rather not, to be honest. No offense.
- Please don't tell me you love {like}. We can still be friends.
- I'll pass on {like}. Thanks, though.
- Give me anything but {like}. Hehe.

@rule small.like.no.convince~state
on small
when likes=no
shape state
hook like_no_convince
opens ask,share,invite
- I don't get the appeal of {like}. Convince me.
- {Like}? Hmm. Maybe I just haven't tried it right.
- Maybe I'd change my mind if someone showed me. Maybe.

@rule small.like.no.pass~q
on small
when likes=no
shape q
hook like_no_pass
opens ask,agree,tease
- Eh, {like}... Do you like it?
- Not a big {like} person, sorry. What do you like about it?
- {Like} and I don't really click. Sorry, are you a fan?
- Why, are you into {like}? Oh no.

@rule small.like.no.convince~q
on small
when likes=no
shape q
hook like_no_convince
opens ask,share,invite
- I've only heard bad things about {like}. Prove them wrong?

@rule small.pet.food.talk~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=food
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_food_talk
opens ask,praise,tease
- Did you eat yet? I had lunch at eleven and I'm already starving.
- There's a new bakery by the station. I went twice. Today.
- My stomach growled in the middle of the lecture. Everyone heard.
- I keep a snack in every bag I own. Don't laugh, it's planning.
- Thursday is curry day at the cafeteria. I count down to it.
- I made a whole pot of rice last night. It's gone.

@rule small.pet.food.talk~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=food
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_food_talk
opens ask,praise,tease
- Have you eaten yet? Be honest.

@rule small.pet.food.ask~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=food
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_food_ask
opens share,ask,invite
- What's the best thing you ate this week?
- Where do you go when you're starving between classes?
- Do you think the cafeteria would sell me two desserts?

@rule small.pet.food.ask~show
on small
when subject=pet pet=food
feel smile
shape show
hook pet_food_ask
opens share,ask,invite
- Look, I saved half my melon bread. Want some?

@rule small.pet.books.talk~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=books
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_books_talk
opens ask,praise,invite
- I stayed up till three finishing a novel. Worth it.
- The sequel comes out next month. I already pre-ordered it.
- I found a used bookshop near campus. I lost two hours there.
- I always carry a book. In case the line is long.
- I cried on the train because of a book. Very cool of me.

@rule small.pet.books.ask~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=books
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_books_ask
opens share,ask,tease
- Do you read? Like, actual books?
- Have you ever read something that changed how you think?
- What was the last book you couldn't put down?

@rule small.pet.books.talk~show
on small
when subject=pet pet=books
feel smile
shape show
hook pet_books_talk
opens ask,praise,invite
- This one. Read the first page. Just one.

@rule small.pet.music.talk~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=music
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_music_talk
opens ask,praise,invite
- I've had the same song stuck in my head since Monday.
- I made a new playlist for walking to class. It's perfect.
- I went to a tiny live show last weekend. My ears are still ringing.
- I used to play the piano. My fingers still remember some of it.
- My earphones broke and the whole day felt too quiet.

@rule small.pet.music.ask~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=music
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_music_ask
opens share,ask,tease
- What are you listening to these days?
- Do you have a song for when you're sad?
- Have you ever been to a live show?

@rule small.pet.music.talk~show
on small
when subject=pet pet=music
feel smile
shape show
hook pet_music_talk
opens ask,praise,invite
- Here, take one earphone. Just listen to the chorus.

@rule small.pet.sports.talk~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=sports
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_sports_talk
opens ask,praise,invite
- We had volleyball practice this morning. My arms are dead.
- I beat my best time on the track yesterday. Barely.
- I can't sit still in lectures. My legs want to run.
- My knee's a bit sore, but it's the good kind of sore.
- We've got a match on Saturday. I'm way too excited.

@rule small.pet.sports.ask~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=sports
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_sports_ask
opens share,ask,tease
- Do you play anything? Or are you a spectator?
- Want to see who's faster sometime?
- Do you think I should try out for the main team?

@rule small.pet.sports.talk~show
on small
when subject=pet pet=sports
feel smile
shape show
hook pet_sports_talk
opens ask,praise,invite
