@rule small.pet.cleaning.talk~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=cleaning
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_cleaning_talk
opens ask,praise,agree
- I reorganized my desk by color last night. It's beautiful.
- Someone left their tray on the table again. It's been bothering me all day.
- I bought a label maker. I've labeled everything. Even the labels.
- The club room was a mess, so I stayed late and fixed it.

@rule small.pet.cleaning.ask~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=cleaning
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_cleaning_ask
opens share,ask,tease
