@rule small.pet.naps.talk~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=naps
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_naps_talk
opens ask,agree,tease
- I took a nap between classes and woke up in a different period.
- I found a secret napping spot. It has shade and everything.
- I could sleep anywhere. I slept on the bus standing up once.
- Twenty minutes. That's all I need. Then I'm a new person.
- I tried to stay up studying. I woke up on my notes.

@rule small.pet.naps.ask~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=naps
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_naps_ask
opens share,ask,tease
