@rule small.pet.naps.talk~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=naps
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_naps_talk
opens ask,agree,tease
- How many hours did you sleep last night? Mine's embarrassing.
- Is it rude to nap in the library? Asking for me.

@rule small.pet.naps.talk~show
on small
when subject=pet pet=naps
feel smile
shape show
hook pet_naps_talk
opens ask,agree,tease
- Feel this cushion. I carry it around. Don't judge.

@rule small.pet.studying.talk~state
on small
when subject=pet pet=studying
feel smile
shape state
hook pet_studying_talk
opens ask,praise,tease
- I color-coded all my notes this week. Five colors.
- I made flashcards for the whole exam. Three hundred of them.
- I'm already two chapters ahead. It calms me down.
- The library opens at eight. I was there at eight.
- I finally understood that proof. I almost cheered out loud.

@rule small.pet.studying.ask~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=studying
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_studying_ask
opens share,ask,invite
- Did you start studying for the exam yet?
- Do you want to compare notes sometime?

@rule small.pet.studying.talk~q
on small
when subject=pet pet=studying
feel smile
shape q
hook pet_studying_talk
opens ask,praise,tease
- How do you study? I'm always looking for better ways.

@rule small.pet.studying.talk~show
on small
when subject=pet pet=studying
feel smile
shape show
hook pet_studying_talk
opens ask,praise,tease
