- My socks got wet this morning, checking on the strays. I left them a box.
- I left my umbrella with the strays... Maybe someone will share theirs...
- I hope the cats near the gate found somewhere dry. I left them a box.
- I worry about the strays on days like this. Is that silly?

@rule small.weather.rain.gentle.staying
