- We had to do indoor training! Worst day ever!
- They moved everything to the gym! So cramped!
- If I sit still any longer, I'll explode! Help!
- My shoes went squish all the way to campus! Squish, squish!
- {student}My bag's soaked! My assignments are fine. Probably!
- It better be sunny tomorrow! I mean it!
- This rain owes me a practice! Hmph!

