# ---- the library: books first, then the quiet and the exams, then the rain, then a fight on her mind

@rule small.place.library.books.rain.fight.rain
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study=yes wet=yes fight=yes
feel shy
hook place_library_books_rain_fight_rain
opens ask,comfort,share
- I came here to read with the rain on the windows... It helps me stop thinking about {fightwho}.
- The library sounds different when it rains. Then I forget about the thing with {fightwho}. Almost.
- I like reading while it rains. It's the only place I don't think about the fight with {fightwho}.
- Rain, a good book, and no {fightwho}. That's all I want today.
- I needed somewhere quiet after what happened with {fightwho}. The rain kind of covers everything up.
- Is it weird that the rain makes it easier? Even {fightwho}.
- Everything feels farther away in here when it rains. Even that stupid fight.
- I picked the longest book they had. So I wouldn't have to go back.
- I chose the saddest book on the shelf. It matches {fightwho} and me.
- {Fightwho} hates the rain anyway. So I'm safe here.
- {Fightwho} won't come out in this. Good.
- I can read here until the rain stops. Maybe later.
- Once it stops, I'll have to face {fightwho}. I'm not ready.
- Don't ask me what happened. Just sit here.
- I don't want to talk about {fightwho}, but thanks. The rain's enough.
- I read the same line ten times. Thinking of {fightwho}.
- The rain's the only thing I can follow. Stupid {fightwho}.

@rule small.place.library.books.rain.cozy~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study=yes wet=yes
feel smile
shape state
hook place_library_books_rain_cozy
opens ask,share,tease
- Rain outside, a book in here. Perfect afternoon.
- Reading while it rains is the best. I could stay until they lock the doors.
- I always come to the library on rainy days. It's tradition.
- The best seat is by the window when it rains. I got here first.
- Rain makes the pages smell older. I know that sounds weird.
- Rainy days are reading days. That's the rule.
- I've got a blanket in my bag for this. Don't tell the librarian.
- If they served tea, I'd never leave. Seriously.
- Sit down, you're letting the rain in. Hehe.
- You're dripping on the books. Careful!
- The rain gives you an excuse not to leave. I love that.
- Nobody asks why you're here on a day like this. Perfect.

@rule small.place.library.books.rain.read~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study=yes wet=yes
feel smile
shape state
hook place_library_books_rain_read
opens ask,share,tease
- I've been saving a mystery for a rainy day. Finally.
- I can recommend something for this weather. Here.
- Want something good to read till it stops? It's short.

@rule small.place.library.books.rain.cozy~q
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study=yes wet=yes
feel smile
shape q
hook place_library_books_rain_cozy
