@rule small.place.library.books.fight.corner
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study=yes fight=yes
feel sad
hook place_library_books_fight_corner
opens ask,comfort,share
- I came here to hide in a book. After what happened with {fightwho}...
- Books don't argue with you. {Fightwho} and I aren't talking right now.
- Reading helps when people are... complicated. After what happened with {fightwho}...
- I keep reading the same page. I keep thinking about {fightwho}.
- I can't focus. Stupid fight with {fightwho}.
- The library's the one place {fightwho} never comes. That's why I'm here.
- It's quiet. I needed quiet. You can stay, though.
- This character is having a worse time than me. That helps.
- At least in the book, they make up. Lucky them.
- {Fightwho} borrowed my favorite book, you know. I want it back.
- I still have a book {fightwho} gave me. I don't know what to do with it.
- I don't need advice. Just quiet. Thanks.
- Please don't mention {fightwho} here. This is my safe place.
- A story's easier to fix than a fight. Isn't it?
- If I could rewrite yesterday... I would.
- I'm fine, I just needed a corner. Really.
- This is my corner when things are bad. You found it.

@rule small.place.library.books.exam.prepared
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study=yes exam=yes
feel serious
hook place_library_books_exam_prepared
