- I've read everything twice. You should study too.
- Studying here is the only way I focus. Don't distract me. ...Okay, a little.
- The library's full of panicking people this week. I came early to get this one.
- Every seat's taken during exam week. Lucky me.
- I made flash cards for the exam. Want to borrow some?
- I'm on chapter seven. How far are you?
- I've got notes on my notes. It's fine.
- My highlighter's almost dead. I've used three.
- {student}I read that it's better to sleep than cram. I'm not doing it.
- I keep telling myself to rest. It's not working.
- You look like you haven't opened a book yet. Hm?
- Have you studied at all? Be honest.
- Quiet, this is the hard chapter. One minute.
- Wait, let me finish this page. Almost.
- I know which questions will come up. Probably.
- I found last year's exam. Want to look?

@rule small.place.library.books.reader~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=library l_study=yes
feel smile
shape state
