- Books, quiet, nobody yelling. I come here every chance I get.
- The smell of old books is the best. Don't laugh!
- I could live in this library. Seriously.
- I'm halfway through a really good novel. I can't put it down.
- The librarian knows my name now. That's how often I'm here.
- That's my usual seat, by the way. You can have it today.
- Sometimes I read a whole book in one go. Oops.
- I forgot lunch again because of a book. It happens.
- One more chapter, then I'll talk. Just kidding.
- I was at the good part. It's okay, I'll stop.

@rule small.place.library.books.shelf~state
