- Books aren't really my thing. Shh, don't judge.
- I've been on page one for an hour. Don't check.
- Everyone whispers here. It's creepy. Hehe.
- It's so quiet that I can hear myself chew. Sorry.
- Can we go? I'm dying. Please.
- If I stay any longer, I'll turn into dust. Save me.
- What do people even do in here? Seriously.

