- The rain sounds nice from in here. At least it's dry.
- It's so crowded today. Too many people.
- Rain on the windows. Library smell. Not bad.
- The library's cozy on rainy days. I get it now.
- I came in to get away from the rain. Might as well read something.
- The rain drove me in here. I don't even like books.
- The librarian looks stressed. Poor thing.
- There's a line for the seats by the heater. Wow.
- People are drying their socks on the radiators. Gross.
- Somebody's umbrella is dripping everywhere. The librarian's going to explode.
- It's not a bad place to wait it out. Join me?
- I'll stay until it stops. Might be a while.
- The rain's louder than anyone in here. Nice, huh?
- It's so quiet, you can hear every drop. Listen.
- I took a picture book to pass the time. Don't laugh.
- I'm pretending to read. Shh.

# ---- the classroom: the time of day and the exams, then the rain at the windows

@rule small.place.classroom.rain.window
on small
when subject=place placeid=classroom wet=yes
hook place_classroom_rain_window
opens ask,share,tease
- Watching the rain from class is my hobby. Better than the lesson.
- The windows are all fogged up. Someone drew a heart on it.
- Listen to it hit the glass. Kind of relaxing.
- Nobody wants to go outside. So loud in here.
- The lecture hall's packed because of the rain. Everyone eats inside now.
- {student}I'm staring out the window again. Don't tell the professor.
- Rainy lecture hall, sleepy lecture hall. I almost dozed off.
- Class felt endless today. My eyelids...
- {student}The professor's voice and the rain are a deadly mix. Zzz.
- Somebody left a window open. Who did that?
- {student}My desk's a little wet. Thanks, whoever.
- The room's so gray. It's depressing.
- They turned on all the lights at noon. Weird, right?
- I can't see the field anymore. Just rain.
- {student}All I can see from my seat is gray. Pretty, though.
- Everyone's stuck here until it stops. We could talk.
- Nobody's leaving anytime soon. Got anything to do?

@rule small.place.classroom.exam.tense
