- Exam week. In this room. Again. Ugh.
- Do you think we'll pass? Tell me we'll pass.
- I studied until two. I'm running on nothing.
- I keep looking at the clock. Is it over yet?
- This desk has seen too many exams. So many doodles.
- My stomach's been hurting since morning. I'm not ready.
- My hands are shaking. It's nothing.
- Nobody's talking. It's creepy. So tense.
- You could hear a pencil drop in here. Right?
- The answer was right there and I blanked. I hate this.
- I can't stop going over question five. What did you put?
- I want to burn all my notes when this is over. I mean it.
- After this, I'm sleeping for a week. Don't wake me.
- Say something normal. Anything. Please.
- Distract me for a second. I need it.

