- I always eat too fast. Then I'm hungry again by fifth period.
- I traded my egg for someone's sausage. Good deal.
- The desks are a mess at lunch. Not my crumbs.
- There are crumbs all over my notebook. Ugh.
- The class is nicer at lunch. Nobody's stressed.

