- Everybody's eating in here because of the rain. It's like a festival.
- It's so packed today. We could squeeze in.
- No seats left, thanks to the rain. Ugh.
- The windows are all steamed up. Smells good in here, though.
- Hot soup on a rainy day is perfect. Want some?
- The rain made the line twice as long. Worth it.
- I almost slipped on the wet floor. Carry my tray?
- I've never seen the line this long. Unbelievable.
- I've been standing here for ten minutes. Keep me company.
- All the tables by the window are taken. Figures.
- Nobody's going out, so nobody's leaving. We're stuck.
- It smells like wet jackets and curry. Lovely.
- Wet umbrellas everywhere. Watch your step.
- I'd have eaten on the roof today. Thanks, rain.
- This was supposed to be a picnic day. Oh well.
- Nobody's in a hurry to leave. Fine by me.
