# ---- the rooftop and the courtyard: outside, so the weather weighs a lot

@rule small.place.rooftop.rain.soaked
on small
when subject=place placeid=rooftop wet=yes
feel surprised
hook place_rooftop_rain_soaked
opens ask,invite,tease,comfort
- Why are we up here in the rain? Hehe.
- The rooftop's all ours. Nobody else is crazy enough. Kinda nice, though.
- We're getting soaked! I don't even care anymore.
- The city looks blurry from up here. Pretty, right?
- You can see the rain coming over the rooftops. Look!
- We should go in before we catch a cold. Five more minutes.
- My shoes are full of water. Okay, maybe now.
- Who else would come up here with you? Only me.
- This was your idea, remember. Hehe.
- I can't see a thing. It's all gray.
- My glasses would be useless up here. Good thing I don't wear any.
- The door's going to lock if we're not careful. Oops.
- Hope nobody saw us come up. Shh.
- The university looks so empty from here. Nice, huh?
- Everyone's inside, and we're out here. Us two idiots.
- I've got one towel, and it's small. Share it?
- You're shivering. Come closer.

@rule small.place.rooftop.lover.city
on small
when subject=place placeid=rooftop wet=yes rainlover=yes
feel smile
hook place_rooftop_lover_city
opens ask,invite,share
- I come up here when it rains. On purpose. Don't tell anyone.
- Rain on the rooftop is the best. Close your eyes. Listen.
- Nobody comes up here when it rains. It's mine. Well, ours now.
- The rain feels different up here. Closer to the sky.
- I like letting it fall on my face. Try it.
- Everyone runs from the rain. I don't get it. It's just water.
- Rain on the rooftop is my secret. Now it's yours too.
- Hear that? Each surface has its own note. Listen.
- The tin roof over there sounds best. Shh.
- I've got a raincoat stashed behind the door. Prepared.
- I keep a change of clothes in my locker just for this. Don't laugh.
- The sky feels really close today. Doesn't it?
- Up here, it almost feels like I'm in a cloud. Almost.
- You're the first person I've brought up here for this. Lucky you.
- You can stay, if you don't complain. Deal?
- Look at how it moves across the city. So pretty.
- You can watch it cross the river from here. There!

@rule small.place.rooftop.clear.invite~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=rooftop weather=clear
feel smile
shape state
hook place_rooftop_clear_invite
