- This is my secret spot. Well, not so secret now. Don't tell anyone.
- I can see my house from here. Almost. I think.
- That dot over there might be my house. Maybe.
- I get the best phone signal up here. True story.
- If they moved the lecture halls up here, I'd never be late. Promise.
- It's a little windy for a skirt. Don't look.
- Hold on to your lunch, the wind's strong. Whoa.

