@rule small.place.courtyard.rain.empty
on small
when subject=place placeid=courtyard wet=yes
hook place_courtyard_rain_empty
opens ask,invite,tease
- The courtyard's empty in the rain. Kind of peaceful.
- All the benches are soaked. No sitting today.
- Nobody out here but us. Lucky us?
- The flowers look happy, at least. Someone has to be.
- Listen to the rain on the leaves. Pretty.
- We should get under the roof. Come here.
- My umbrella's tiny. Squeeze in.
- The pond's overflowing. Look.
- There's a little river running down the path. Cool, right?
- The frogs are loving this. Listen.
- I heard a frog somewhere. Hehe.
- I just wanted some air. Wet air, I guess.
- It's stuffy inside. This is better.
- That bench is a pond now. Don't try it.
- I sat down without looking. Big mistake.
- Nobody's watching us from the windows, I hope. Hehe.
- Everyone's probably staring at us from class. Wave.

@rule small.place.courtyard.animals.cat~state
