- I saw the stray cat again this morning. She let me pet her!
- The courtyard cat has a boyfriend now. A big orange one.
- I bring treats for the cat on Fridays. She waits for me.
- Mochi's getting fat. I can tell.
- Shh, don't scare her. There.
- Move slowly. She doesn't know you. Let her come to you.
- I've got scratches on both hands. Worth it. Totally.
