# ---- the field, the gym and the pool: sports first, then the weather

@rule small.place.field.sports.track~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=field clubkind=sports
feel smile
shape state
hook place_field_sports_track
opens ask,praise,tease
- I practically live on this field. Smell that grass!
- Practice is my favorite part of the day. No class can beat it.
- Coach is making us run extra this week. My legs are dead.
- Some days I'm out here before anyone else. Just me and the track.
- The field at sunset is the best. Trust me.
- I beat my best time this morning. Finally!
- I've got grass stains on everything. Worth it.
- {student}My uniform will never be clean again. Sorry, mom.
- Warm-ups are the worst part. Boring.
- Don't walk across the track! Kidding.
- Watch out, ball! Hehe.

@rule small.place.field.sports.dare~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=field clubkind=sports
feel smile
shape state
hook place_field_sports_dare
opens ask,invite,tease
- Want to run a lap with me? Bet you can't keep up!
- We have a match coming up. Come cheer for us!
- I'm this close to a new record. Watch me!
- You'd be fast, with some practice. I could train you.

@rule small.place.field.sports.dare~offer
on small
when subject=place placeid=field clubkind=sports
feel smile
shape offer
hook place_field_sports_dare
