- Stretch with me. Come on!

@rule small.place.field.rain.mud
on small
when subject=place placeid=field wet=yes
hook place_field_rain_mud
opens ask,invite,tease
- The field is all mud now. We warmed up in it. My cleats are ruined.
- Practice is cancelled. We found out after the warm-up. Thanks, rain.
- Look at those puddles. Wanna jump in one?
- We're running drills in the hallway instead. Everyone keeps slipping.
- The track's flooded. Ridiculous.
- Nobody's out here but us idiots. Proud of it.
- Running in the rain is kind of fun, though. Don't tell anyone.
- The coach is standing there anyway. Crazy.
- Our captain still made us warm up. In this!
- My socks will never be white again. Oh well.
- I've got mud up to my knees. Look!
- Slide tackle, anyone? I'm serious.
- You can slide ten meters on that. Bet you won't.
- We've got a match coming, and now this. Ugh.
- A whole day of practice wasted. So annoying.
- The goal nets are dripping. Sad.
- The lines have washed away. We'll have to redraw them.

@rule small.place.gym.rain.chaos
on small
when subject=place placeid=gym wet=yes
hook place_gym_rain_chaos
opens ask,invite,tease
- {student}Every club's crammed in the gym because of the rain. We had to share half a court.
- The gym's chaos today. Balls flying everywhere.
- Three teams, one gym. Watch your head.
- The roof's so loud when it rains. You can't hear the coach.
- Rain on the gym roof sounds like drums. Kind of cool.
- Outdoor clubs are stuck in here with us. Hehe.
- The track team is running laps around the gym. Dizzy just watching.
- I got hit by a volleyball, thanks. Ow.
- Somebody's badminton thing hit me. I'm fine.
- It smells like everyone's socks in here. Ugh.
- The floor's slippery from all the wet shoes. Careful.
- The basketball team's mad at us. Not my fault.
- We lost the good half of the court. Unfair.
- It's so hot in here with everyone. So stuffy.
- The windows have fogged up. Open something.
- I like it, it's like a festival. Kind of.
- It's fun seeing all the clubs in one place. Sort of.

@rule small.place.gym.exercise.gym~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=gym l_exercise=yes
feel smile
shape state
hook place_gym_exercise_gym
opens ask,praise,tease
- I love the gym. Sweat is just weakness leaving.
- The gym's where I feel most like me. No thinking, just moving.
- I've been working on my serve. It's getting good.
- If you don't feel it tomorrow, you didn't try. That's the rule.
- My legs will hate me tomorrow. Worth it.
- You should lift more. I can tell.
- You've got decent arms, you know. For a beginner.
- I feel weird on days I don't move. It's true.
- If I skip a day, I get cranky. Ask anyone.

@rule small.place.gym.exercise.dare~state
