- Race you to the wall! Loser buys drinks!
- Let's see how many push-ups you can do. Bet I can do more.
- Hold my feet for sit-ups? Just for a minute.

@rule small.place.gym.exercise.gym~q
on small
when subject=place placeid=gym l_exercise=yes
feel smile
shape q
hook place_gym_exercise_gym
opens ask,praise,tease
