@rule small.place.pool.rain.water
on small
when subject=place placeid=pool wet=yes
hook place_pool_rain_water
opens ask,invite,tease
- Swimming in the rain is weird. You're wet either way. Hehe.
- Pool's closed when it thunders. Rules are rules.
- The rain makes little circles on the water. Pretty, right?
- Nobody's swimming today. Just us.
- The pool looks so sad in the rain. Poor pool.
- Rain or not, I'm wet anyway. Might as well.
- Coach still made us swim. Rain is nothing.
- The lifeguard's chair looks lonely. Poor thing.
- The lane ropes are bouncing around. Look.
- The water's warmer than the air today. Crazy, right?
- It's warmer in the water, believe it or not. Really.
- I like swimming with the rain on my back. You should see it.
- From underwater, the rain looks amazing. Try it.
- My hair's already wet, so who cares? Hehe.
- No point in using an umbrella here. Right?
- Practice will end if the thunder starts. Fingers crossed.
- If it gets worse, they'll clear the pool. We'll see.

@rule small.place.pool.clear.swim~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=pool weather=clear
feel smile
shape state
hook place_pool_clear_swim
opens ask,share,tease
- Perfect pool weather. I wish I could jump in right now.
- Want to swim? I'm kidding. Mostly. You're blushing.
- I could float here all day. Lucky swimmers.
- I'd give anything for a cannonball right now. One day.
- Bet you can't make a bigger splash. Try me.
- Everyone wants to be in the swim club today. Funny.

@rule small.place.pool.clear.summer~state
on small
when subject=place placeid=pool weather=clear
feel smile
shape state
hook place_pool_clear_summer
opens ask,share,comfort
- The water's so blue today. Sparkly.
- The sun on the water is so pretty. Look.
- The pool smells like summer. Chlorine and sunscreen.
- My shoulders are going to burn. Oops.
- The tiles are hot enough to cook on. Ow, ow.
- Careful, the concrete's burning. Ouch!
- There's a crowd at the fence today. I wonder why.
- The water looks unreal. Pretty.

@rule small.place.pool.clear.summer~q
on small
when subject=place placeid=pool weather=clear
feel smile
shape q
hook place_pool_clear_summer
opens ask,share,comfort
