# ---- the infirmary: how she feels, and what she's hiding from

@rule small.place.infirmary.fight.hiding
on small
when subject=place placeid=infirmary fight=yes
feel sad
hook place_infirmary_fight_hiding
opens ask,comfort,share
- I said I had a headache. I don't. I just needed a break.
- I'm not sick. I just didn't want to see {fightwho}. Please don't tell anyone.
- It's quiet here. Nobody asks questions. Except you, apparently.
- {student}The nurse let me lie down for a while. I didn't want to go back to class.
- I've been staring at the ceiling. Thinking about {fightwho}.
- Hiding in the infirmary is pathetic, right? Don't answer that.
- It's easier than facing {fightwho}. For now.
- {Fightwho} might come looking for me. Don't tell.
- If {fightwho} walks in, tell them I'm asleep. Please.
- The bed's comfortable, at least. That's something.
- Nobody here wants anything from me. It's nice.
- I've been crying a bit, don't look. Sorry.
- My eyes are red, aren't they? It's allergies.
- What did I even say to {fightwho}? I feel awful.
- I can't remember who started it. It doesn't matter.
- Thanks for coming to check. Nobody else did.
- You came all the way here? You're nice.

@rule small.place.infirmary.sleepy.nap
on small
when subject=place placeid=infirmary mood=sleepy
feel shy
hook place_infirmary_sleepy_nap
opens comfort,tease,ask
- The infirmary beds are so comfy... Shh.
- I'm just resting my eyes. Don't tell.
- Five more minutes. Please?
- I didn't sleep at all last night. Zombie mode.
- {student}The nurse took pity on me. Lucky.
- This pillow is better than mine at home. Seriously.
- Can you wake me before the bell? Thanks.
- {student}I told the nurse I had a fever. Don't look at me.
- I may have exaggerated my symptoms. A little.
- Why are you here? I was almost asleep. Mmm.
- Who let you in? Let me sleep. Go away. Or stay.
- The curtains block the light so nicely. Mmm.
- It's so warm under this blanket. Heaven.
- Next period's only math, right? I'll skip it.
- What period is it? Tell me later.
- Just lie there and be quiet with me. Shh.
- You can sit there if you're quiet. Thanks.

