- This room's like a second home. I have a drawer of snacks in that corner.
- We spend so much time in here. Too much, maybe.
- Everyone left their stuff everywhere again. Typical.
- I'm the only one who cleans in here. Not fair.
- We've got a bet on who'll be president next. It's serious.
- The seniors are leaving soon. It'll be weird.
- Someone ate the whole box of cookies. Unforgivable.
- I found a three-year-old sandwich in here. True story.
- This wall has every member's name on it. Mine's here.
- There's a photo of us over there. Look.

