@rule small.place.clubroom.rain.tea
on small
when subject=place placeid=clubroom wet=yes
hook place_clubroom_rain_tea
opens ask,invite,share
- Rainy days are tea days in the club room. Cozy, right?
- Everyone's in here because of the rain. It's packed, and the pot's still going.
- We made tea because of the rain. Want some?
- The windows are rattling. I'm keeping the door shut.
- Somebody's umbrella is dripping on my bag. Ugh.
- Rain means board games in the club room. Join us!
- We're playing cards till it stops. You in?
- Practice got moved in here. Tight, huh?
- Nobody felt like going home in this. Fine by me.
- It's nicer here than in the hallway. Sit down.
- We're drying our socks on the heater. Don't look.
- Somebody brought instant noodles. Want one?
- We've got cocoa, too. It's the rule on rainy days.
- I'm supposed to be working, but this rain... Mmm.
- Nobody's getting anything done today. Oh well.
- We may be stuck here for a while. You too?
- Might as well stay until it stops. Sit.

# ---- anywhere: a fight on her mind, and the girl she can't stand nearby

@rule small.place.fight.fight
on small
when subject=place fight=yes
feel sad
hook place_fight_fight
opens ask,comfort,share
- Sorry, I'm not great company today. It's stupid.
- I had a fight with {fightwho}. We're not talking.
- My head's somewhere else. You noticed?
- Have you ever said something you couldn't take back? Yeah. Me too, today.
- {Fightwho} and I had a big one. It's been a bad week.
- I don't want to talk about {fightwho}. ...Maybe later.
- I'm trying not to think about the fight. It's not working.
- Do I look that bad? Great.
- Is it that obvious? I tried to hide it.
- {Fightwho} didn't even look at me this morning. So that's that.
- I walked past {fightwho} today. Nothing.
- Can you just talk about something else? Please.
- Tell me something dumb. Anything. Distract me.
- Maybe I was wrong. Don't tell {fightwho} that.
- I said some things to {fightwho}. I can't take them back.
- I keep checking my phone, like an idiot. Stupid.
- {Fightwho} hasn't texted. Neither have I.

@rule small.place.rivalnear.rival
on small
when subject=place rivalnear=*
feel pout
hook place_rivalnear_rival
opens ask,tease,comfort
- Ugh, {rivalnear} is here. Let's go somewhere else.
- Of all the people... {rivalnear}. Just ignore her.
- Don't look now, but {rivalnear} is staring. Great.
- {Rivalnear} and I don't exactly get along. Long story.
- Can we talk somewhere {rivalnear} isn't? Please?
- If {rivalnear} says anything, I'm leaving. Fair warning.
- I can feel {rivalnear} judging me. Ignore it. I'm trying.
- Why does {rivalnear} always show up here? Every time.
- {Rivalnear} is following me, I swear. I'm not paranoid.
- Quick, laugh like I said something funny. {Rivalnear}'s looking.
- Act like you're having a great time with me. Do it.
- Don't you dare be nice to {rivalnear}. I mean it.
- If you talk to {rivalnear}, we're done. Kidding. Sort of.
- Ugh, that voice. So fake.
- You hear that laugh? {Rivalnear}. I can't stand it.
- I've got nothing against {rivalnear}. Except everything. Don't ask.
- {Rivalnear} and I have history. It's complicated.

